<https://example.org/dmo#diagnosisId> owl:equivalentProperty <https://example.org/dmo#diagnosisId> .

<https://example.org/dmo#diagnosisKind> owl:equivalentProperty <https://example.org/dmo#diagnosisKind> .

<https://example.org/dmo#documentVersion> owl:equivalentProperty <https://example.org/dmo#documentVersion> .

<https://example.org/dmo#endDate> owl:equivalentProperty <https://example.org/dmo#endDate>;
  rdfs:comment "结束日期" .

<https://example.org/dmo#externalCode> owl:equivalentProperty <https://example.org/dmo#externalCode>;
  rdfs:comment "编码体系中的诊断代码" .

<https://example.org/dmo#factOrigin> owl:equivalentProperty <https://example.org/dmo#factOrigin>;
  rdfs:comment "事实来源层。ehr-legacy=真实上游库；derived=ETL 推导；demo-cohort=演示队列。演示数据永远带得上这个标记，不会被误当真实病历。" .

<https://example.org/dmo#frequencyCategory> owl:equivalentProperty <https://example.org/dmo#frequencyCategory>;
  rdfs:comment "发生频度分类" .

<https://example.org/dmo#gradingSystem> owl:equivalentProperty <https://example.org/dmo#gradingSystem>;
  rdfs:comment "证据分级体系，如 ADA、GRADE、VA-DoD" .

<https://example.org/dmo#indicationText> owl:equivalentProperty <https://example.org/dmo#indicationText>;
  rdfs:comment "适应证摘要；结构化适应证通过 treatsDiagnosis 关系表达" .

<https://example.org/dmo#jurisdiction> owl:equivalentProperty <https://example.org/dmo#jurisdiction>;
  rdfs:comment "适用国家、地区或医疗体系" .

<https://example.org/dmo#languageCode> owl:equivalentProperty <https://example.org/dmo#languageCode>;
  rdfs:comment "BCP 47 语言代码，如 en-US、zh-CN" .

<https://example.org/dmo#locator> owl:equivalentProperty <https://example.org/dmo#locator>;
  rdfs:comment "页码、章节、表格或字符区间" .

<https://example.org/dmo#lowerOperator> owl:equivalentProperty <https://example.org/dmo#lowerOperator>;
  rdfs:comment "下界比较操作符：大于、大于等于或无下界" .

<https://example.org/dmo#medicationUseId> owl:equivalentProperty <https://example.org/dmo#medicationUseId>;
  rdfs:comment "用药记录唯一标识" .

<https://example.org/dmo#nativeEvidenceGrade> owl:equivalentProperty <https://example.org/dmo#nativeEvidenceGrade>;
  rdfs:comment "来源指南原始证据等级；不得跨分级体系臆造转换" .

<https://example.org/dmo#observationId> owl:equivalentProperty <https://example.org/dmo#observationId>;
  rdfs:comment "临床观察唯一标识" .

<https://example.org/dmo#observationType> owl:equivalentProperty <https://example.org/dmo#observationType>;
  rdfs:comment "观察指标类型" .

<https://example.org/dmo#observedAt> owl:equivalentProperty <https://example.org/dmo#observedAt>;
  rdfs:comment "观察时间" .

<https://example.org/dmo#onsetDate> owl:equivalentProperty <https://example.org/dmo#onsetDate>;
  rdfs:comment "估计起病日期" .

<https://example.org/dmo#passageId> owl:equivalentProperty <https://example.org/dmo#passageId>;
  rdfs:comment "证据片段唯一标识" .

<https://example.org/dmo#quote> owl:equivalentProperty <https://example.org/dmo#quote>;
  rdfs:comment "经过逐字验证的支持文本" .

<https://example.org/dmo#recommendationStrength> owl:equivalentProperty <https://example.org/dmo#recommendationStrength>;
  rdfs:comment "推荐强度；来源未明确时为 Unspecified" .

<https://example.org/dmo#regimenRole> owl:equivalentProperty <https://example.org/dmo#regimenRole>;
  rdfs:comment "治疗方案中的角色，不包含剂量" .

<https://example.org/dmo#resolvedDate> owl:equivalentProperty <https://example.org/dmo#resolvedDate>;
  rdfs:comment "缓解或结束日期" .

<https://example.org/dmo#retrievedAt> owl:equivalentProperty <https://example.org/dmo#retrievedAt>;
  rdfs:comment "本地副本获取时间" .

<https://example.org/dmo#ruleId> owl:equivalentProperty <https://example.org/dmo#ruleId>;
  rdfs:comment "执行该评估的 SPARQL/SHACL 规则标识" .

<https://example.org/dmo#ruleVersion> owl:equivalentProperty <https://example.org/dmo#ruleVersion>;
  rdfs:comment "规则版本" .

<https://example.org/dmo#sourceUnit> owl:equivalentProperty <https://example.org/dmo#sourceUnit>;
  rdfs:comment "单位换算前的原始单位。上游无单位列时为空 —— 空即拒绝数值判定。" .

<https://example.org/dmo#sourceValue> owl:equivalentProperty <https://example.org/dmo#sourceValue>;
  rdfs:comment "单位换算前的原始数值。换算在 ETL 做，原始值必须保留以便复核。" .

<https://example.org/dmo#startDate> owl:equivalentProperty <https://example.org/dmo#startDate>;
  rdfs:comment "开始日期" .

<https://example.org/dmo#status> owl:equivalentProperty <https://example.org/dmo#status>;
  rdfs:comment "观察记录状态" .

<https://example.org/dmo#unitCode> owl:equivalentProperty <https://example.org/dmo#unitCode>;
  rdfs:comment "UCUM 单位代码" .

<https://example.org/dmo#upperOperator> owl:equivalentProperty <https://example.org/dmo#upperOperator>;
  rdfs:comment "上界比较操作符：小于、小于等于或无上界" .

<https://example.org/dmo#valueDecimal> owl:equivalentProperty <https://example.org/dmo#valueDecimal>;
  rdfs:comment "数值型结果；非数值观察留空" .

<https://example.org/dmo#valueText> owl:equivalentProperty <https://example.org/dmo#valueText>;
  rdfs:comment "枚举或文本结果；数值观察可留空" .

<https://example.org/dmo#valueTrustLevel> owl:equivalentProperty <https://example.org/dmo#valueTrustLevel>;
  rdfs:comment "该数值的可信度。Attested=上游真实断言；Curated=人工策展的演示数据；Unverified=上游随机/未经核验的值。Unverified 默认不参与阈值判定。" .

<https://example.org/dmo#verificationStatus> owl:equivalentProperty <https://example.org/dmo#verificationStatus>;
  rdfs:comment "诊断确定性" .

<https://example.org/dmo#hasClinicalObservation> owl:equivalentProperty <https://example.org/dmo#hasClinicalObservation>;
  rdfs:comment "患者历次非实验室临床观察。" .

<https://example.org/dmo#observationRecordedAt> owl:equivalentProperty <https://example.org/dmo#observationRecordedAt>;
  rdfs:comment "临床观察记录所在的就诊事件。" .

<https://example.org/dmo#observationOfSymptom> owl:equivalentProperty <https://example.org/dmo#observationOfSymptom>;
  rdfs:comment "症状类观察对应的症状术语；非症状观察不使用该关系。" .

<https://example.org/dmo#hasAssessment> owl:equivalentProperty <https://example.org/dmo#hasAssessment>;
  rdfs:comment "患者的阈值评估结论。刻意加这条直连边：不加的话从 Assessment 回到 Patient 要走 basedOnLabResult → producesLabResult → hasEncounter 三跳，查询层每个模板都要重复这段 join，写错一处就静默少结果。" .

<https://example.org/dmo#hasDiagnosis> owl:equivalentProperty <https://example.org/dmo#hasDiagnosis>;
  rdfs:comment "患者历次诊断或临床判断记录。" .

<https://example.org/dmo#diagnosedAt> owl:equivalentProperty <https://example.org/dmo#diagnosedAt>;
  rdfs:comment "诊断作出或记录所在的就诊事件。" .

<https://example.org/dmo#diagnosisType> owl:equivalentProperty <https://example.org/dmo#diagnosisType>;
  rdfs:comment "糖尿病或糖尿病前期诊断对应的术语节点。" .

<https://example.org/dmo#diagnosisComplication> owl:equivalentProperty <https://example.org/dmo#diagnosisComplication>;
  rdfs:comment "并发症、合并症或急性事件诊断对应的术语节点。" .

<https://example.org/dmo#currentStage> owl:equivalentProperty <https://example.org/dmo#currentStage>;
  rdfs:comment "该次诊断记录对应的当前分期。" .

<https://example.org/dmo#basedOnLabResult> owl:equivalentProperty <https://example.org/dmo#basedOnLabResult>;
  rdfs:comment "评估使用的一个或多个检验结果。" .

<https://example.org/dmo#appliesThreshold> owl:equivalentProperty <https://example.org/dmo#appliesThreshold>;
  rdfs:comment "评估所应用的版本化诊断阈值。" .

<https://example.org/dmo#supportsDiagnosis> owl:equivalentProperty <https://example.org/dmo#supportsDiagnosis>;
  rdfs:comment "评估支持但不单独决定的诊断记录。" .

<https://example.org/dmo#hasMedicationUse> owl:equivalentProperty <https://example.org/dmo#hasMedicationUse>;
  rdfs:comment "患者历次用药记录。" .

<https://example.org/dmo#usesMedication> owl:equivalentProperty <https://example.org/dmo#usesMedication>;
  rdfs:comment "用药记录对应的具体药物成分。" .

<https://example.org/dmo#treatsDiagnosis> owl:equivalentProperty <https://example.org/dmo#treatsDiagnosis>;
  rdfs:comment "该用药记录所针对的一个或多个诊断。" .

<https://example.org/dmo#medicationRecordedAt> owl:equivalentProperty <https://example.org/dmo#medicationRecordedAt>;
  rdfs:comment "用药记录创建或更新所在的就诊事件。" .

<https://example.org/dmo#hasPassage> owl:equivalentProperty <https://example.org/dmo#hasPassage>;
  rdfs:comment "指南来源包含的可验证证据片段。" .

<https://example.org/dmo#thresholdCitesPassage> owl:equivalentProperty <https://example.org/dmo#thresholdCitesPassage>;
  rdfs:comment "诊断阈值的精确来源片段。" .

<https://example.org/dmo#recommendationCites> owl:equivalentProperty <https://example.org/dmo#recommendationCites>;
  rdfs:comment "推荐条目的精确支持片段。" .

<https://example.org/dmo#riskRuleId> owl:equivalentProperty <https://example.org/dmo#riskRuleId> .

<https://example.org/dmo#observedKind> owl:equivalentProperty <https://example.org/dmo#observedKind>;
  rdfs:comment "该规则读哪一类患者事实：ClinicalObservation.observationType 的取值（BMI / SmokingStatus / …），或 'Diagnosis'（按 ICD-10 码匹配），或 'Age'（由 birthYear 推导）。" .

<https://example.org/dmo#observedCode> owl:equivalentProperty <https://example.org/dmo#observedCode>;
  rdfs:comment "observedKind='Diagnosis' 时要匹配的 ICD-10 码。" .

<https://example.org/dmo#matchValue> owl:equivalentProperty <https://example.org/dmo#matchValue>;
  rdfs:comment "文本型观察要匹配的取值，如吸烟状态的 'Current'。与 ruleLowerBound 二选一。" .

<https://example.org/dmo#mapsToRiskFactor> owl:equivalentProperty <https://example.org/dmo#mapsToRiskFactor>;
  rdfs:comment "⚠️ 指向 urn:dmo:extract:* 里的抽取个体，是**跨图引用**。抽取产物重跑后 IRI 可能变，load_graphdb.py --verify 有一条检查专门盯这个：每个 mapsToRiskFactor 的目标必须在图里存在，否则该规则静默失效。" .

<https://example.org/dmo#triggerBasis> owl:equivalentProperty <https://example.org/dmo#triggerBasis>;
  rdfs:comment "'corpus-verbatim' = 判定条件直接来自所引原文；'external-standard' = 数值边界来自本仓库语料之外，必须配 externalStandardNote。" .

<https://example.org/dmo#externalStandardNote> owl:equivalentProperty <https://example.org/dmo#externalStandardNote> .

<https://example.org/dmo#riskRuleCitesPassage> owl:equivalentProperty <https://example.org/dmo#riskRuleCitesPassage> .

<https://example.org/dmo#hasRiskFactorHit> owl:equivalentProperty <https://example.org/dmo#hasRiskFactorHit> .

<https://example.org/dmo#hitsRiskRule> owl:equivalentProperty <https://example.org/dmo#hitsRiskRule> .

<https://example.org/dmo#hitRiskFactor> owl:equivalentProperty <https://example.org/dmo#hitRiskFactor> .

<https://example.org/dmo#hitFromFact> owl:equivalentProperty <https://example.org/dmo#hitFromFact>;
  rdfs:comment "命中所依据的那条患者事实（ClinicalObservation 或 Diagnosis）。API 靠它把结论接回 SQL 原始行。" .

<https://example.org/dmo#ruleLowerBound> owl:equivalentProperty <https://example.org/dmo#ruleLowerBound> .

<https://example.org/dmo#ruleLowerOperator> owl:equivalentProperty <https://example.org/dmo#ruleLowerOperator>;
  rdfs:comment "GT / GTE / None，语义与 DiagnosticThreshold 的 lowerOperator 一致。" .

<https://example.org/dmo#ruleUpperBound> owl:equivalentProperty <https://example.org/dmo#ruleUpperBound> .

<https://example.org/dmo#ruleUpperOperator> owl:equivalentProperty <https://example.org/dmo#ruleUpperOperator>;
  rdfs:comment "LT / LTE / None。" .

owl:Thing owl:equivalentClass owl:Thing .

owl:Nothing owl:equivalentClass owl:Nothing .

<https://example.org/dmo#Patient> owl:equivalentClass <https://example.org/dmo#Patient>;
  rdfs:comment "接受糖尿病筛查、诊断或管理的个体。只保存稳定人口学属性；会随时间变化的临床事实通过就诊、观察、诊断和用药记录表达。";
  rdfs:label "Patient" .

<https://example.org/dmo#DiabetesType> owl:equivalentClass <https://example.org/dmo#DiabetesType>;
  rdfs:comment "糖尿病分型术语节点（T1DM / T2DM / GDM / 单基因 / 前期 / 继发性）。ER 模型中分型是实例而非子类，OWL 子类层次另在 Turtle TBox 中维护。";
  rdfs:label "DiabetesType" .

<https://example.org/dmo#ClinicalEncounter> owl:equivalentClass <https://example.org/dmo#ClinicalEncounter>;
  rdfs:comment "一次就诊/接触事件，是检验结果的时间锚点。妊娠相关就诊记录孕周。";
  rdfs:label "ClinicalEncounter" .

<https://example.org/dmo#LabTest> owl:equivalentClass <https://example.org/dmo#LabTest>;
  rdfs:comment "检验项目定义（术语层），如 A1C、FPG、OGTT-2h、随机血糖、UACR、eGFR、尿酮体。";
  rdfs:label "LabTest" .

<https://example.org/dmo#LabResult> owl:equivalentClass <https://example.org/dmo#LabResult>;
  rdfs:comment "患者在特定时间完成的一次检验结果。只保存原始测量事实；诊断或目标解释由独立 Assessment 实体记录。";
  rdfs:label "LabResult" .

<https://example.org/dmo#DiagnosticThreshold> owl:equivalentClass <https://example.org/dmo#DiagnosticThreshold>;
  rdfs:comment "把数值区间映射到分类结论的阈值节点。这是数值推理的落点——OWL-RL 做不到数值区间推理，因此阈值建模为数据，由 SPARQL CONSTRUCT 消费。";
  rdfs:label "DiagnosticThreshold" .

<https://example.org/dmo#GlycemicTarget> owl:equivalentClass <https://example.org/dmo#GlycemicTarget>;
  rdfs:comment "血糖管理目标区间，仅包含 A1C、餐前/餐后血糖和 TIR；血压与血脂等非血糖目标不在此实体中。";
  rdfs:label "GlycemicTarget" .

<https://example.org/dmo#Complication> owl:equivalentClass <https://example.org/dmo#Complication>;
  rdfs:comment "糖尿病并发症与合并症，含慢性（DKD/DR/DPN/DFU/CVD）与急性（低血糖/DKA/HHS）两类。";
  rdfs:label "Complication" .

<https://example.org/dmo#ComplicationStage> owl:equivalentClass <https://example.org/dmo#ComplicationStage>;
  rdfs:comment "并发症分期节点（NPDR→PDR、CKD G1-G5/A1-A3、低血糖 Level 1-3）。stageOrder 支撑 OWL TransitiveProperty worseThan 的传递闭包。";
  rdfs:label "ComplicationStage" .

<https://example.org/dmo#Symptom> owl:equivalentClass <https://example.org/dmo#Symptom>;
  rdfs:comment "症状/体征节点，用于「症状 → 可能情形」的多跳检索与急诊分流。";
  rdfs:label "Symptom" .

<https://example.org/dmo#RiskFactor> owl:equivalentClass <https://example.org/dmo#RiskFactor>;
  rdfs:comment "风险因素节点，区分可干预与不可干预——这是生活方式干预建议能否落地的判据。";
  rdfs:label "RiskFactor" .

<https://example.org/dmo#DrugClass> owl:equivalentClass <https://example.org/dmo#DrugClass>;
  rdfs:comment "降糖药物类别（二甲双胍/SU/TZD/DPP4i/SGLT2i/GLP-1RA/胰岛素等）。禁忌与不良反应挂在类别层，而非单药层。";
  rdfs:label "DrugClass" .

<https://example.org/dmo#Medication> owl:equivalentClass <https://example.org/dmo#Medication>;
  rdfs:comment "具体药物成分节点（通用名）。胰岛素的时效属性放在这一层，因为同类胰岛素起效时间差异显著。";
  rdfs:label "Medication" .

<https://example.org/dmo#Contraindication> owl:equivalentClass <https://example.org/dmo#Contraindication>;
  rdfs:comment "禁忌/慎用规则节点。这是「一般用 X，除非 Y」这类默认规则的落点——不进 OWL TBox，作为数据由 SHACL 安全形状消费。";
  rdfs:label "Contraindication" .

<https://example.org/dmo#AdverseEffect> owl:equivalentClass <https://example.org/dmo#AdverseEffect>;
  rdfs:comment "药物不良反应节点。与 Complication 分开：不良反应归因于药物，并发症归因于疾病；低血糖两者都可指向，靠边不同区分。";
  rdfs:label "AdverseEffect" .

<https://example.org/dmo#LifestyleIntervention> owl:equivalentClass <https://example.org/dmo#LifestyleIntervention>;
  rdfs:comment "生活方式干预节点（营养、身体活动、体重管理、戒烟、自我管理教育 DSMES）。";
  rdfs:label "LifestyleIntervention" .

<https://example.org/dmo#Device> owl:equivalentClass <https://example.org/dmo#Device>;
  rdfs:comment "监测与给药设备节点（CGM、胰岛素泵、血糖仪、人工胰腺、尿酮试纸）。";
  rdfs:label "Device" .

<https://example.org/dmo#MonitoringSchedule> owl:equivalentClass <https://example.org/dmo#MonitoringSchedule>;
  rdfs:comment "随访/筛查频率节点（UACR 与 eGFR 每年、散瞳眼底每年、A1C 每 3 个月、GDM 24-28 周、正常者每 3 年复查）。";
  rdfs:label "MonitoringSchedule" .

<https://example.org/dmo#Recommendation> owl:equivalentClass <https://example.org/dmo#Recommendation>;
  rdfs:comment "指南推荐条目。指南逻辑一律建模为数据实例而非 TBox 公理——这是本设计最关键的一条边界。";
  rdfs:label "Recommendation" .

<https://example.org/dmo#GuidelineSource> owl:equivalentClass <https://example.org/dmo#GuidelineSource>;
  rdfs:comment "出处节点。provenance 是本体 agent 相对纯 RAG 的核心卖点，因此出处是一等公民实体，而不是字符串字段。";
  rdfs:label "GuidelineSource" .

<https://example.org/dmo#Diabetes> owl:equivalentClass <https://example.org/dmo#Diabetes>;
  rdfs:comment "所有糖尿病分型的上位类。Prediabetes 刻意不作为它的子类——前期不是糖尿病。";
  rdfs:label "Diabetes" .

<https://example.org/dmo#GlucoseMetabolismDisorder> owl:equivalentClass <https://example.org/dmo#GlucoseMetabolismDisorder>;
  rdfs:comment "糖代谢异常的总类，同时涵盖 Diabetes 与 Prediabetes。";
  rdfs:label "GlucoseMetabolismDisorder" .

<https://example.org/dmo/id/T1DM> owl:equivalentClass <https://example.org/dmo/id/T1DM>;
  rdfs:label "Type 1 Diabetes" .

<https://example.org/dmo/id/T2DM> owl:equivalentClass <https://example.org/dmo/id/T2DM>;
  rdfs:label "Type 2 Diabetes" .

<https://example.org/dmo/id/GDM> owl:equivalentClass <https://example.org/dmo/id/GDM>;
  rdfs:label "Gestational Diabetes" .

<https://example.org/dmo/id/MODY> owl:equivalentClass <https://example.org/dmo/id/MODY>;
  rdfs:label "Monogenic Diabetes" .

<https://example.org/dmo/id/Prediabetes> owl:equivalentClass <https://example.org/dmo/id/Prediabetes>;
  rdfs:comment "刻意不是 Diabetes 的子类。把前期归进糖尿病是本领域最常见的建模错误。";
  rdfs:label "Prediabetes" .

<https://example.org/dmo#DiabetesPatient> owl:equivalentClass <https://example.org/dmo#DiabetesPatient>,
    _:node917;
  rdfs:label "DiabetesPatient" .

<https://example.org/dmo#InsulinDependentPatient> owl:equivalentClass <https://example.org/dmo#InsulinDependentPatient>,
    _:node921;
  rdfs:label "InsulinDependentPatient" .

<https://example.org/dmo#Organ> owl:equivalentClass <https://example.org/dmo#Organ>;
  rdfs:label "Organ" .

<https://example.org/dmo/id/CKD-G1> owl:equivalentClass <https://example.org/dmo/id/CKD-G1>;
  rdfs:label "CKD G1" .

<https://example.org/dmo/id/CKD-G2> owl:equivalentClass <https://example.org/dmo/id/CKD-G2>;
  rdfs:label "CKD G2" .

<https://example.org/dmo/id/CKD-G3a> owl:equivalentClass <https://example.org/dmo/id/CKD-G3a>;
  rdfs:label "CKD G3a" .

<https://example.org/dmo/id/CKD-G3b> owl:equivalentClass <https://example.org/dmo/id/CKD-G3b>;
  rdfs:label "CKD G3b" .

<https://example.org/dmo/id/CKD-G4> owl:equivalentClass <https://example.org/dmo/id/CKD-G4>;
  rdfs:label "CKD G4" .

<https://example.org/dmo/id/CKD-G5> owl:equivalentClass <https://example.org/dmo/id/CKD-G5>;
  rdfs:comment "肾衰竭：肾功能低于正常的 15%。";
  rdfs:label "CKD G5" .

<https://example.org/dmo/id/DR-NPDR> owl:equivalentClass <https://example.org/dmo/id/DR-NPDR>;
  rdfs:label "Nonproliferative Diabetic Retinopathy" .

<https://example.org/dmo/id/DR-PDR> owl:equivalentClass <https://example.org/dmo/id/DR-PDR>;
  rdfs:label "Proliferative Diabetic Retinopathy" .

<https://example.org/dmo/id/Hypo-L1> owl:equivalentClass <https://example.org/dmo/id/Hypo-L1>;
  rdfs:label "Hypoglycemia Level 1" .

<https://example.org/dmo/id/Hypo-L2> owl:equivalentClass <https://example.org/dmo/id/Hypo-L2>;
  rdfs:label "Hypoglycemia Level 2" .

<https://example.org/dmo/id/Hypo-L3> owl:equivalentClass <https://example.org/dmo/id/Hypo-L3>;
  rdfs:label "Severe Hypoglycemia" .

<https://example.org/dmo#AcuteComplication> owl:equivalentClass <https://example.org/dmo#AcuteComplication>;
  owl:disjointWith <https://example.org/dmo#ChronicComplication>;
  rdfs:label "AcuteComplication" .

<https://example.org/dmo#ChronicComplication> owl:equivalentClass <https://example.org/dmo#ChronicComplication>;
  rdfs:label "ChronicComplication" .

<https://example.org/dmo/id/DKD> owl:equivalentClass <https://example.org/dmo/id/DKD>;
  rdfs:label "Diabetic Kidney Disease" .

<https://example.org/dmo/id/DR> owl:equivalentClass <https://example.org/dmo/id/DR>;
  rdfs:label "Diabetic Retinopathy" .

<https://example.org/dmo/id/DME> owl:equivalentClass <https://example.org/dmo/id/DME>;
  rdfs:label "Diabetic Macular Edema" .

<https://example.org/dmo/id/DPN> owl:equivalentClass <https://example.org/dmo/id/DPN>;
  rdfs:label "Diabetic Peripheral Neuropathy" .

<https://example.org/dmo/id/DFU> owl:equivalentClass <https://example.org/dmo/id/DFU>;
  rdfs:label "Diabetic Foot Ulcer" .

<https://example.org/dmo/id/CVD> owl:equivalentClass <https://example.org/dmo/id/CVD>;
  rdfs:label "Cardiovascular Disease" .

<https://example.org/dmo/id/Hypoglycemia> owl:equivalentClass <https://example.org/dmo/id/Hypoglycemia>;
  rdfs:label "Hypoglycemia" .

<https://example.org/dmo/id/DKA> owl:equivalentClass <https://example.org/dmo/id/DKA>;
  rdfs:label "Diabetic Ketoacidosis" .

<https://example.org/dmo/id/HHS> owl:equivalentClass <https://example.org/dmo/id/HHS>;
  rdfs:label "Hyperosmolar Hyperglycemic State" .

<https://example.org/dmo/id/KidneyFailure> owl:equivalentClass <https://example.org/dmo/id/KidneyFailure> .

<https://example.org/dmo/id/DM-Unspecified> owl:equivalentClass <https://example.org/dmo/id/DM-Unspecified>;
  rdfs:comment "诊断阈值命中后的默认结论。与 T1DM/T2DM 等不互斥——它表示「还没分型」，不是第六种类型。" .

<https://example.org/dmo/id/CKD> owl:equivalentClass <https://example.org/dmo/id/CKD> .

<https://example.org/dmo/id/Microalbuminuria> owl:equivalentClass <https://example.org/dmo/id/Microalbuminuria> .

<https://example.org/dmo/id/Macroalbuminuria> owl:equivalentClass <https://example.org/dmo/id/Macroalbuminuria> .

<https://example.org/dmo#ClinicalObservation> owl:equivalentClass <https://example.org/dmo#ClinicalObservation>;
  rdfs:comment "患者在特定时间的非实验室临床观察，如 BMI、血压、吸烟状态、妊娠状态和孕周。用于替代 Patient 上会随时间变化的属性。" .

<https://example.org/dmo#Diagnosis> owl:equivalentClass <https://example.org/dmo#Diagnosis>;
  rdfs:comment "患者的一次诊断或临床判断记录，连接患者、就诊、疾病术语和分期；保留诊断状态、确定性与时间。" .

<https://example.org/dmo#Assessment> owl:equivalentClass <https://example.org/dmo#Assessment>;
  rdfs:comment "基于一个或多个检验结果和版本化规则生成的解释结论；不覆盖原始 LabResult。" .

<https://example.org/dmo#MedicationUse> owl:equivalentClass <https://example.org/dmo#MedicationUse>;
  rdfs:comment "患者使用某种药物的一段治疗记录，连接患者、药物、诊断与就诊；刻意不包含剂量字段。" .

<https://example.org/dmo#SourcePassage> owl:equivalentClass <https://example.org/dmo#SourcePassage>;
  rdfs:comment "指南中的具体证据片段，记录页码、章节或文本定位，使阈值、推荐与安全规则可精确追溯。" .

<https://example.org/dmo/id/HeartFailure> owl:equivalentClass <https://example.org/dmo/id/HeartFailure> .

<https://example.org/dmo/id/LiverDisease> owl:equivalentClass <https://example.org/dmo/id/LiverDisease> .

<https://example.org/dmo#RiskRule> owl:equivalentClass <https://example.org/dmo#RiskRule>;
  rdfs:comment "把一条可观测的患者事实映射到一个指南风险因子的可执行规则。刻意不是 owl:Class 层的公理 —— 「BMI≥25 算超重」是默认规则不是必然真理，塞进 TBox 会让本体在遇到反例时不一致（DESIGN.md 陷阱 #2）。" .

<https://example.org/dmo#RiskFactorHit> owl:equivalentClass <https://example.org/dmo#RiskFactorHit>;
  rdfs:comment "某患者命中某条 RiskRule 的记录。带回溯到具体那条患者事实的指针。" .

