<https://example.org/dmo> rdfs:comment "机械生成部分。公理层见 dmo-axioms.ttl。";
  rdfs:label "Diabetes Care Ontology V2 — TBox 骨架" .

<https://example.org/dmo#unit> rdfs:comment "属性取值的计量单位" .

<https://example.org/dmo#evidenceQuote> rdfs:comment "支持该断言的原文逐字片段" .

<https://example.org/dmo#tboxRoute> rdfs:comment "该类型走 §2.3 的哪条路线：class / skos / individual" .

<https://example.org/dmo#activityTarget> rdfs:comment "可量化目标，如「每周 150 分钟中等强度活动」「减重 5%-7%」";
  rdfs:label "activityTarget" .

<https://example.org/dmo#adminRoute> rdfs:comment "给药途径";
  rdfs:label "adminRoute" .

<https://example.org/dmo#adverseEffectCode> rdfs:comment "不良反应编码";
  rdfs:label "adverseEffectCode" .

<https://example.org/dmo#affectedOrgan> rdfs:comment "受累器官；对应 OWL 属性链 hasComplication ∘ affectsOrgan";
  rdfs:label "affectedOrgan" .

<https://example.org/dmo#appliesTo> rdfs:comment "适用人群描述";
  rdfs:label "appliesTo" .

<https://example.org/dmo#atcCode> rdfs:comment "ATC 编码引用（WHO 版权，仅存 code+label）";
  rdfs:label "atcCode" .

<https://example.org/dmo#birthYear> rdfs:comment "出生年份，用于推导年龄相关风险（≥35 岁列为 T2DM 筛查人群）";
  rdfs:label "birthYear" .

<https://example.org/dmo#boundUnit> rdfs:comment "边界单位";
  rdfs:label "boundUnit" .

<https://example.org/dmo#classification> rdfs:comment "该区间对应的分类结论";
  rdfs:label "classification" .

<https://example.org/dmo#collectedAt> rdfs:comment "采样时间";
  rdfs:label "collectedAt" .

<https://example.org/dmo#complicationCode> rdfs:comment "并发症编码，如 DKD / DR / DME / DPN / DFU / CVD / HYPO / DKA";
  rdfs:label "complicationCode" .

<https://example.org/dmo#contraCode> rdfs:comment "禁忌规则编码";
  rdfs:label "contraCode" .

<https://example.org/dmo#definition> rdfs:comment "来源原文的定义摘录";
  rdfs:label "definition" .

<https://example.org/dmo#deviceCode> rdfs:comment "设备编码";
  rdfs:label "deviceCode" .

<https://example.org/dmo#deviceType> rdfs:comment "设备类别";
  rdfs:label "deviceType" .

<https://example.org/dmo#diabetesTypeCode> rdfs:comment "分型编码，如 T1DM / T2DM / GDM / MODY / PREDIABETES";
  rdfs:label "diabetesTypeCode" .

<https://example.org/dmo#drugClassCode> rdfs:comment "类别编码，如 BIGUANIDE / SGLT2I / GLP1RA / SU / TZD / DPP4I / INSULIN";
  rdfs:label "drugClassCode" .

<https://example.org/dmo#durationHours> rdfs:comment "作用持续时间（小时）";
  rdfs:label "durationHours" .

<https://example.org/dmo#encounterDate> rdfs:comment "就诊日期";
  rdfs:label "encounterDate" .

<https://example.org/dmo#encounterId> rdfs:comment "就诊唯一标识";
  rdfs:label "encounterId" .

<https://example.org/dmo#encounterType> rdfs:comment "就诊类型";
  rdfs:label "encounterType" .

<https://example.org/dmo#evidenceNote> rdfs:comment "证据说明与出处";
  rdfs:label "evidenceNote" .

<https://example.org/dmo#expectedBenefit> rdfs:comment "预期收益，如「T2DM 发病风险降低 58%（60 岁以上 71%）」";
  rdfs:label "expectedBenefit" .

<https://example.org/dmo#fastingRequired> rdfs:comment "是否需要空腹（FPG、OGTT 需空腹≥8 小时）";
  rdfs:label "fastingRequired" .

<https://example.org/dmo#frequencyMonths> rdfs:comment "间隔月数；一次性窗口筛查留空并用 triggerWindow 表达";
  rdfs:label "frequencyMonths" .

<https://example.org/dmo#gestationalWeek> rdfs:comment "孕周；GDM 筛查窗口为 24-28 周";
  rdfs:label "gestationalWeek" .

<https://example.org/dmo#hpoCode> rdfs:comment "HPO CURIE 引用";
  rdfs:label "hpoCode" .

<https://example.org/dmo#hypoglycemiaRisk> rdfs:comment "致低血糖风险；SU 与胰岛素为 High";
  rdfs:label "hypoglycemiaRisk" .

<https://example.org/dmo#insulinAction> rdfs:comment "胰岛素时效分类";
  rdfs:label "insulinAction" .

<https://example.org/dmo#insulinRequired> rdfs:comment "是否必须依赖外源胰岛素维持生命（T1DM 为真）";
  rdfs:label "insulinRequired" .

<https://example.org/dmo#interventionCode> rdfs:comment "干预编码";
  rdfs:label "interventionCode" .

<https://example.org/dmo#interventionType> rdfs:comment "干预类别";
  rdfs:label "interventionType" .

<https://example.org/dmo#isEmergency> rdfs:comment "是否属于需急诊处理的情形（DKA、严重低血糖为真）";
  rdfs:label "isEmergency" .

<https://example.org/dmo#isInsulin> rdfs:comment "是否为胰岛素制剂";
  rdfs:label "isInsulin" .

<https://example.org/dmo#isRealTime> rdfs:comment "是否提供连续实时数据（CGM 可在夜间低血糖时报警）";
  rdfs:label "isRealTime" .

<https://example.org/dmo#labResultId> rdfs:comment "结果唯一标识";
  rdfs:label "labResultId" .

<https://example.org/dmo#labTestCode> rdfs:comment "检验编码，如 A1C / FPG / OGTT2H / RPG / GCT1H / UACR / EGFR / KETONE";
  rdfs:label "labTestCode" .

<https://example.org/dmo#localFile> rdfs:comment "本仓库中的采集副本路径，如 ontology/knowledges/niddk-a1c-test.txt";
  rdfs:label "localFile" .

<https://example.org/dmo#loincCode> rdfs:comment "LOINC 编码引用（仅存 code+label，不分发全表）";
  rdfs:label "loincCode" .

<https://example.org/dmo#lowerBound> rdfs:comment "区间下界（含）。无下界时留空";
  rdfs:label "lowerBound" .

<https://example.org/dmo#mechanism> rdfs:comment "作用机制的通俗描述（来自 FDA 原文）";
  rdfs:label "mechanism" .

<https://example.org/dmo#medicationCode> rdfs:comment "药物编码";
  rdfs:label "medicationCode" .

<https://example.org/dmo#mondoCode> rdfs:comment "MONDO CURIE，如 MONDO:0005147";
  rdfs:label "mondoCode" .

<https://example.org/dmo#name> rdfs:comment "分型名称";
  rdfs:label "name" .

<https://example.org/dmo#onsetMinutes> rdfs:comment "起效时间（分钟）——描述药代特征，不是给药建议";
  rdfs:label "onsetMinutes" .

<https://example.org/dmo#onsetPattern> rdfs:comment "起病模式";
  rdfs:label "onsetPattern" .

<https://example.org/dmo#patientId> rdfs:comment "患者唯一标识（假名化）";
  rdfs:label "patientId" .

<https://example.org/dmo#populationContext> rdfs:comment "适用人群；妊娠期使用不同 cutoff";
  rdfs:label "populationContext" .

<https://example.org/dmo#populationScope> rdfs:comment "适用人群限定";
  rdfs:label "populationScope" .

<https://example.org/dmo#prevalenceShare> rdfs:comment "占糖尿病总病例比例（T2DM 约 90-95%）";
  rdfs:label "prevalenceShare" .

<https://example.org/dmo#publishedYear> rdfs:comment "发布/最后审阅年份";
  rdfs:label "publishedYear" .

<https://example.org/dmo#publisher> rdfs:comment "发布机构";
  rdfs:label "publisher" .

<https://example.org/dmo#rationale> rdfs:comment "机制解释与出处，如二甲双胍与乳酸酸中毒风险";
  rdfs:label "rationale" .

<https://example.org/dmo#recommendationId> rdfs:comment "推荐唯一标识";
  rdfs:label "recommendationId" .

<https://example.org/dmo#recommendationType> rdfs:comment "推荐类别";
  rdfs:label "recommendationType" .

<https://example.org/dmo#resultUnit> rdfs:comment "结果单位，须与 LabTest.unitOfMeasure 一致（SHACL 校验点）";
  rdfs:label "resultUnit" .

<https://example.org/dmo#resultValue> rdfs:comment "测量数值";
  rdfs:label "resultValue" .

<https://example.org/dmo#riskCategory> rdfs:comment "是否可干预";
  rdfs:label "riskCategory" .

<https://example.org/dmo#riskFactorCode> rdfs:comment "风险因素编码";
  rdfs:label "riskFactorCode" .

<https://example.org/dmo#rxNormCode> rdfs:comment "RxNorm 编码引用";
  rdfs:label "rxNormCode" .

<https://example.org/dmo#scheduleId> rdfs:comment "计划唯一标识";
  rdfs:label "scheduleId" .

<https://example.org/dmo#severity> rdfs:comment "禁忌强度：绝对禁忌 / 相对禁忌 / 需谨慎评估";
  rdfs:label "severity" .

<https://example.org/dmo#sex> rdfs:comment "生理性别；CVD 风险与 GDM 相关规则依赖该字段";
  rdfs:label "sex" .

<https://example.org/dmo#sourceId> rdfs:comment "出处唯一标识";
  rdfs:label "sourceId" .

<https://example.org/dmo#sourceUrl> rdfs:comment "原文链接";
  rdfs:label "sourceUrl" .

<https://example.org/dmo#specimen> rdfs:comment "标本类型";
  rdfs:label "specimen" .

<https://example.org/dmo#stageCode> rdfs:comment "分期编码，如 CKD-G4 / DR-PDR / HYPO-L2";
  rdfs:label "stageCode" .

<https://example.org/dmo#stageCriteria> rdfs:comment "分期判定标准（引用检验区间，不含处置剂量）";
  rdfs:label "stageCriteria" .

<https://example.org/dmo#stageOrder> rdfs:comment "严重度序号，越大越重；传递序关系的基础";
  rdfs:label "stageOrder" .

<https://example.org/dmo#statement> rdfs:comment "推荐正文（不含任何具体剂量数字）";
  rdfs:label "statement" .

<https://example.org/dmo#symptomCode> rdfs:comment "症状编码";
  rdfs:label "symptomCode" .

<https://example.org/dmo#targetHigh> rdfs:comment "目标上界";
  rdfs:label "targetHigh" .

<https://example.org/dmo#targetId> rdfs:comment "目标唯一标识";
  rdfs:label "targetId" .

<https://example.org/dmo#targetLow> rdfs:comment "目标下界";
  rdfs:label "targetLow" .

<https://example.org/dmo#targetMetric> rdfs:comment "目标指标";
  rdfs:label "targetMetric" .

<https://example.org/dmo#targetPopulation> rdfs:comment "适用人群描述，如「多数成人」「合并心血管疾病者更严格」";
  rdfs:label "targetPopulation" .

<https://example.org/dmo#targetUnit> rdfs:comment "目标单位";
  rdfs:label "targetUnit" .

<https://example.org/dmo#thresholdId> rdfs:comment "阈值唯一标识，如 A1C-DIABETES-NONPREG";
  rdfs:label "thresholdId" .

<https://example.org/dmo#triggerCriteria> rdfs:comment "触发条件的可判定表述，如「严重肾功能损害或透析」";
  rdfs:label "triggerCriteria" .

<https://example.org/dmo#triggerWindow> rdfs:comment "触发窗口，如「妊娠 24-28 周」「产后 12 周内」「T1DM 病程满 5 年起」";
  rdfs:label "triggerWindow" .

<https://example.org/dmo#typicalOnset> rdfs:comment "典型起病阶段";
  rdfs:label "typicalOnset" .

<https://example.org/dmo#unitOfMeasure> rdfs:comment "结果单位，如 percent / mg-per-dL / mg-per-g / mL-per-min";
  rdfs:label "unitOfMeasure" .

<https://example.org/dmo#upperBound> rdfs:comment "区间上界（含）。无上界时留空";
  rdfs:label "upperBound" .

<https://example.org/dmo#urgency> rdfs:comment "紧急程度；Emergency 触发「立即就医」话术而非解释性回答";
  rdfs:label "urgency" .

<https://example.org/dmo#weightEffect> rdfs:comment "体重影响；TZD/SU 增重，GLP-1RA/SGLT2i 减重";
  rdfs:label "weightEffect" .

<https://example.org/dmo#hasEncounter> rdfs:comment "患者的历次就诊记录。";
  rdfs:label "hasEncounter" .

<https://example.org/dmo#producesLabResult> rdfs:comment "一次就诊产生的检验结果。";
  rdfs:label "producesLabResult" .

<https://example.org/dmo#measuredByTest> rdfs:comment "结果对应的检验项目定义。";
  rdfs:label "measuredByTest" .

<https://example.org/dmo#hasThreshold> rdfs:comment "检验项目的诊断切点集合（正常/前期/糖尿病，妊娠与非妊娠分支）。";
  rdfs:label "hasThreshold" .

<https://example.org/dmo#classifiesInto> rdfs:comment "阈值命中后支持的诊断类别术语；不得单凭血糖阈值推断 T1DM 或 T2DM 病因分型。";
  rdfs:label "classifiesInto" .

<https://example.org/dmo#thresholdCitedFrom> rdfs:comment "阈值的出处，保证每个数字都能追溯。";
  rdfs:label "thresholdCitedFrom" .

<https://example.org/dmo#hasStage> rdfs:comment "并发症的分期集合。";
  rdfs:label "hasStage" .

<https://example.org/dmo#predisposesTo> rdfs:comment "该分型易发生的并发症，例如 T1DM 更易发生 DKA。";
  rdfs:label "predisposesTo" .

<https://example.org/dmo#presentsWith> rdfs:comment "并发症的典型症状表现。";
  rdfs:label "presentsWith" .

<https://example.org/dmo#screenedByTest> rdfs:comment "并发症的筛查手段，例如 DKD 由 UACR 与 eGFR 双指标筛查。";
  rdfs:label "screenedByTest" .

<https://example.org/dmo#hasRiskFactor> rdfs:comment "患者具备的风险因素。";
  rdfs:label "hasRiskFactor" .

<https://example.org/dmo#increasesRiskOf> rdfs:comment "风险因素指向的疾病分型。";
  rdfs:label "increasesRiskOf" .

<https://example.org/dmo#belongsToDrugClass> rdfs:comment "药物所属类别。";
  rdfs:label "belongsToDrugClass" .

<https://example.org/dmo#hasContraindication> rdfs:comment "该类药物的禁忌规则。";
  rdfs:label "hasContraindication" .

<https://example.org/dmo#triggeredByCondition> rdfs:comment "触发禁忌的临床情形，例如 SGLT2i 禁用于严重肾功能损害/透析。";
  rdfs:label "triggeredByCondition" .

<https://example.org/dmo#causesAdverseEffect> rdfs:comment "该类药物的常见不良反应。";
  rdfs:label "causesAdverseEffect" .

<https://example.org/dmo#usesDevice> rdfs:comment "患者使用的监测/给药设备。";
  rdfs:label "usesDevice" .

<https://example.org/dmo#deviceMeasuresTest> rdfs:comment "设备可测量的指标，例如 CGM 对应 TIR 与葡萄糖。";
  rdfs:label "deviceMeasuresTest" .

<https://example.org/dmo#followsIntervention> rdfs:comment "患者执行中的生活方式干预。";
  rdfs:label "followsIntervention" .

<https://example.org/dmo#mitigatesRiskFactor> rdfs:comment "干预针对的可改变风险因素。";
  rdfs:label "mitigatesRiskFactor" .

<https://example.org/dmo#appliesToType> rdfs:comment "推荐适用的分型。";
  rdfs:label "appliesToType" .

<https://example.org/dmo#targetsComplication> rdfs:comment "推荐针对的并发症。";
  rdfs:label "targetsComplication" .

<https://example.org/dmo#recommendsDrugClass> rdfs:comment "推荐涉及的药物类别（类别级，不到具体剂量）。";
  rdfs:label "recommendsDrugClass" .

<https://example.org/dmo#recommendsLifestyle> rdfs:comment "推荐涉及的生活方式干预。";
  rdfs:label "recommendsLifestyle" .

<https://example.org/dmo#definesTarget> rdfs:comment "推荐所定义的管理目标区间。";
  rdfs:label "definesTarget" .

<https://example.org/dmo#definesSchedule> rdfs:comment "推荐所定义的随访/筛查频率。";
  rdfs:label "definesSchedule" .

<https://example.org/dmo#schedulesTest> rdfs:comment "随访计划所安排的检验项目。";
  rdfs:label "schedulesTest" .

<https://example.org/dmo#targetMeasuredBy> rdfs:comment "目标所依据的检验项目。";
  rdfs:label "targetMeasuredBy" .

<https://example.org/dmo#citesSource> rdfs:comment "推荐的出处。每条回答必须能回溯到这里。";
  rdfs:label "citesSource" .

<https://example.org/dmo#worseThan> rdfs:comment "传递闭包：G4 worseThan G3、G3 worseThan G2 ⟹ G4 worseThan G2。";
  rdfs:label "worseThan" .

<https://example.org/dmo/id/threshold/A1C-NORMAL> rdfs:comment "「below 5.7%」是**开区间**：5.7 本身不属于 Normal，属于 Prediabetes。用 LTE 近似会把 5.7 错判成正常 —— S16 边界场景专测这一条。" .

<https://example.org/dmo/id/threshold/RPG-DIABETES> rdfs:comment "⚠️ 这条切点的适用前提是**有症状**（见 RPG-SYMPTOM-Q）。schema 表达不了『前提』，所以引这条 passage，让回答里必须带上它。" .

<https://example.org/dmo/id/threshold/GCT1H-REFER> rdfs:comment "⚠️ 这**不是** GDM 诊断切点，只是转诊触发点：命中后需返回做空腹 OGTT。原文给的是区间「135 到 140 或更高」而非单点，此处取下界 135（更早触发筛查，漏诊代价高于多做一次 OGTT）。GDM 的 OGTT 诊断切点本仓库语料未收录 —— 见下方说明。" .

<https://example.org/dmo/id/threshold/UACR-ALBUMINURIA> rdfs:comment "下界是**开区间**（greater than 30），上界来自 microalbuminuria 区间的另一句原文，故引两条 passage。" .

<https://example.org/dmo/id/threshold/GLUCOSE-HYPO> rdfs:comment "上界开区间（below 70），下界取自重度低血糖切点（below 54）以免两档重叠 —— 54 本身归重度那一档。S10 专测这个开区间。" .

<https://example.org/dmo/id/target/A1C> rdfs:comment "原文：For most people with diabetes, their goal is an A1C level below 7%." .

<https://example.org/dmo/id/target/PREMEAL> rdfs:comment "原文：Before a meal: 80 to 130 mg/dL" .

<https://example.org/dmo/id/target/POSTMEAL> rdfs:comment "原文：About 2 hours after a meal starts: less than 180 mg/dL" .

<https://example.org/dmo/id/target/TIR> rdfs:comment "原文：the target range is between 70 and 180 mg/dL … stay in your target range at least 70% of the time. ⚠️ 区间与占比是两个量，schema 只装得下区间，70% 这个占比目前只在注释里。" .

<https://example.org/dmo/id/target/BP> rdfs:comment "原文：Some people with diabetes have a blood pressure goal below 130/80 mm Hg. ⚠️ 舒张压 80 装不进单值 schema，同上。" .

<https://example.org/dmo/id/guidelineSource/nhc-gdm-nutrition-2018> rdfs:comment "正文缺失，不参与抽取。见 SEMANTIC-LAYER-PLAN §7 风险 1。";
  rdfs:label "nhc-gdm-nutrition-2018" .

<https://example.org/dmo/id/guidelineSource/nhc-gdm-weight-standard-2023> rdfs:comment
    "正文缺失，不参与抽取。见 SEMANTIC-LAYER-PLAN §7 风险 1。";
  rdfs:label "nhc-gdm-weight-standard-2023" .

<https://example.org/dmo/id/target/PREG-FASTING> rdfs:comment "原文：fasting, before meals, at bedtime, and overnight: 70 to 95 mg/dL" .

<https://example.org/dmo/id/target/PREG-1H> rdfs:comment "原文：1 hour after eating: 110 to 140 mg/dL" .

<https://example.org/dmo/id/target/PREG-2H> rdfs:comment "原文：2 hours after eating: 100 to 120 mg/dL" .

<https://example.org/dmo/id/target/PREG-TIR> rdfs:comment "原文：If you are using a CGM, the most often recommended target range for pregnancy is 63 to 140 mg/dL。⚠️ 原文明确说没给固定的达标时间占比：ask your health care team what percentage of time。" .

<https://example.org/dmo/id/target/PREG-A1C> rdfs:comment "原文：Most people with diabetes should aim for an A1C of 6.5% or lower just before pregnancy. After the first 3 months of pregnancy, your target may be as low as 6%。⚠️ 原文同时指出 A1C is not the best test to monitor blood glucose during pregnancy。" .

<https://example.org/dmo#applicableContext> rdfs:comment "评估时使用的人群与临床上下文" .

<https://example.org/dmo#assessedAt> rdfs:comment "评估生成时间" .

<https://example.org/dmo#assessmentId> rdfs:comment "评估唯一标识" .

<https://example.org/dmo#caveat> rdfs:comment "对该结论的限定说明，如「单次异常不等于确诊，需另一日复测确认」。" .

<https://example.org/dmo#clinicalStatus> rdfs:comment "当前临床状态" .

<https://example.org/dmo#codeSystem> rdfs:comment "该临床记录采用的编码体系，如 ICD-10-CM 或 SNOMED CT" .

<https://example.org/dmo#conclusion> rdfs:comment "规则得出的解释结论" .

<https://example.org/dmo#confirmationRequired> rdfs:comment "是否需要复测或额外临床证据确认" .

<https://example.org/dmo#contentHash> rdfs:comment "规范化片段 SHA-256" .

<https://example.org/dmo#demoScenario> rdfs:comment "演示场景编号（如 S02）。真实患者留空。" .

<https://example.org/dmo#diagnosedDate> rdfs:comment "诊断日期" .

<https://example.org/dmo#diagnosisId> rdfs:comment "诊断记录唯一标识" .

<https://example.org/dmo#diagnosisKind> rdfs:comment "诊断记录类别" .

<https://example.org/dmo#documentVersion> rdfs:comment "指南或文档版本" .

<https://example.org/dmo/id/contra-Bromocriptine-Breastfeeding> rdfs:comment "⚠️ **刻意没有 dmo:triggeredByCondition** —— 哺乳是生理状态，不是并发症。 schema 里 triggeredByCondition 的 range 是 Complication，把『哺乳』建成 Complication 是范畴错误，还会污染『已确诊并发症 ⟹ High risk』那条分层规则。 后果：这条禁忌**无法自动判定**，只能在 /safety 里作为文本列出。 这是 schema 的已知缺口（缺少基于 ClinicalObservation 类型的触发表达），由 explain_gap() 如实上报，不用假的 Complication 掩盖。" .

<https://example.org/dmo/id/contra-TZD-HeartFailure> rdfs:comment "⚠️ 原文是 tell your doctor，**不是** Do not take。标成 Absolute 会让 SHACL 报出语料支持不了的违规 —— 这正是原计划里假定为 Absolute 的那一条，实测语料后下调为 Relative。" .

<https://example.org/dmo/id/contra-SGLT2i-RenalHepatic> rdfs:comment "与 contra-SGLT2i-ESRD 是两条：那条针对『重度肾病或透析』是 Absolute，这条针对一般肾/肝问题是 Caution。原文确实是两句话，粒度不同。" .

<https://example.org/dmo/id/contra-Biguanide-Renal> rdfs:comment "⚠️ severity=Caution 而非 Absolute —— 这是 S08 反例的关键：ESRD 患者用二甲双胍**不应**报绝对禁忌违规。原文没有任何 eGFR 数值切点，补一个就是编造。" .

<https://example.org/dmo/id/LabTest-GLU> rdfs:comment "⚠️ 采血时点未知。上游 cdr_lis_result 只有项目名『血糖』，没有空腹/餐后/随机的标注。 因此**不能**套用 FPG（≥126）或 OGTT2H（≥200）的诊断切点 —— 那些切点的成立前提正是采血时点。 只挂与时点无关的四条：低血糖、重度低血糖、酮症警戒、急诊阈值。 演示队列若要走 FPG 判定，必须显式记为 LabTest-FPG，而不是复用这个概念。" .

<https://example.org/dmo/id/LabTest-CREAT> rdfs:comment "⚠️ 刻意不挂 hasThreshold：本仓库语料未收录肌酐的诊断切点。 肾功能判定走 eGFR / UACR，不走裸肌酐。能识别 ≠ 能判定。 单位由上游参考范围 44-133 反推为 µmol/L。" .

<https://example.org/dmo/id/LabTest-BUN> rdfs:comment "⚠️ 刻意不挂 hasThreshold：语料未收录切点。单位由参考范围 2.9-8.2 反推。" .

<https://example.org/dmo/id/LabTest-URINE-PROTEIN> rdfs:comment "⚠️ 定性项目，且刻意不挂 hasThreshold。上游参考范围写的是『阴性』， 说明这是干化学定性，不是定量 —— 上游那一列里的『10.4』根本不该被当数值读。 要判断白蛋白尿必须用 UACR（mg/g，切点 >30），这是两个不同的检验。 map_lab_term 里该项 value_kind='qualitative' + verify_status='unmappable'， 永不进 LabResult，只进 ClinicalObservation.valueText。" .

<https://example.org/dmo/id/LabTest-PLT> rdfs:comment "⚠️ 刻意不挂 hasThreshold：与糖尿病诊断无关，语料无切点。 单位由参考范围 100-300 反推为 10⁹/L。" .

<https://example.org/dmo/id/LabTest-WBC> rdfs:comment "⚠️ 刻意不挂 hasThreshold：语料无切点。单位由参考范围 4-10 反推。" .

<https://example.org/dmo/id/LabTest-HGB> rdfs:comment "⚠️ 刻意不挂 hasThreshold。且**单位反推失败**：上游参考范围 10-15 既不匹配 g/dL 的常规区间（约 12-16），也不匹配 g/L（约 120-160）。 map_lab_term 里该项 verify_status 保持 'candidate'，人工核实前不参与任何换算。 ⚠️ 注意别与糖化血红蛋白（A1C）混为一谈 —— 中文名相近，是完全不同的检验。" .

<https://example.org/dmo/id/LabTest-ALT> rdfs:comment "⚠️ 刻意不挂 hasThreshold：语料无切点。 与糖尿病的关联仅在于部分降糖药的肝功能注意事项，那是 Contraindication 的事。" .

<https://example.org/dmo/id/LabTest-AST> rdfs:comment "⚠️ 刻意不挂 hasThreshold：语料无切点。" .

<https://example.org/dmo/id/LabTest-CHOL> rdfs:comment "⚠️ 刻意不挂 hasThreshold。语料（niddk-managing-diabetes 的 ABCS）只有 『管理胆固醇』的定性表述，没给数值切点。给它安一个 5.2 就是编造出处。 单位由参考范围 3.0-5.2 反推。" .

<https://example.org/dmo/id/LabTest-TG> rdfs:comment "⚠️ 刻意不挂 hasThreshold：语料无数值切点。单位由参考范围 0.56-1.7 反推。" .

<https://example.org/dmo/id/LabTest-TSH> rdfs:comment "⚠️ 刻意不挂 hasThreshold：语料无切点。T1DM 常合并自身免疫性甲状腺病是 常识，但本仓库语料没有收录 TSH 的判读切点，所以不判。" .

<https://example.org/dmo/id/sourcePassage/RPG-DIABETES-Q> rdfs:comment "哈希与 OGTT2H-DIABETES-Q 相同 —— 两处原文逐字一致。内容指纹本就该相同，区分靠 passageId 与 locator。" .

<https://example.org/dmo/id/sourcePassage/RPG-SYMPTOM-Q> rdfs:comment "随机血糖切点的**适用前提**。没有症状时这条切点不成立 —— 目前 schema 表达不了这个前提，只能靠这条 passage 让回答里带上它。" .

<https://example.org/dmo/id/sourcePassage/UACR-MICRO-RANGE-Q> rdfs:comment "UACR-ALBUMINURIA 的**上界**来自这一句，与下界不是同一句原文，所以分成两条 passage。thresholdCitesPassage 是 many-to-many，正是为这种情形准备的。" .

<https://example.org/dmo/id/sourcePassage/UACR-MACRO-Q> rdfs:comment "原文是 300mg/g（无空格），逐字保留。" .

<https://example.org/dmo/id/sourcePassage/RF-AGE35-Q> rdfs:comment "⚠️ 与 RF-AGE45-Q 冲突：CDC 说 45 岁，NIDDK 说 35 岁。两条都是本仓库收录的原文，不是谁抄错。本规则取 35（更敏感，漏筛代价高于多筛一次），两条 passage 都引，让分歧对用户可见 —— 静默取一个才是问题。" .

<https://example.org/dmo/id/riskRule/AGE-35> rdfs:comment "⚠️ 对 hospital_zd 的真实数据**不可用**：patient_basic_info.birthday 的取值范围是 2020-02-24 到 2063-09-14，400 人里 329 人出生日期在未来。年龄推不出来，这条规则对真实患者永远不命中，并在 pred_ 层记为 insufficient_reason='birthday-implausible'。" .

<https://example.org/dmo/id/riskRule/FAMILY-HISTORY-T2DM> rdfs:comment "原文把范围限定在 parent / brother / sister（一级亲属），不是泛指『家族史』。上游 patient_analysis 无此字段，只有演示队列能命中。" .

<https://example.org/dmo/id/riskRule/PHYSICAL-INACTIVITY> rdfs:comment "边界 3 次/周直接来自原文，是少数几条数值边界有出处的规则之一。" .

<https://example.org/dmo/id/riskRule/GDM-HISTORY> rdfs:comment "上游全库 O24 为零条，只能靠演示队列。" .

<https://example.org/dmo/id/riskRule/SMOKING> rdfs:comment "原文是从『可改变因素』的角度提到戒烟，把它读成『吸烟是风险因素』是合理推断但不是逐字断言 —— 保留 corpus-verbatim 的边界判断（Current 是二值，无数值边界），但这条的证据强度弱于 CDC 的显式列表项。" .

<https://example.org/dmo/id/riskRule/ICD-OBESITY> rdfs:comment "这是真实库里**唯一**能命中的体重类风险因子 —— 上游有 19 个 E66，但没有一个 BMI 观察值。" .

<https://example.org/dmo/id/riskRule/ICD-HYPERTENSION> rdfs:comment "⚠️ 这条**没有** riskRuleCitesPassage —— 因为找不到可逐字引用的原文。51-risk-stratification.rq 会因此拒绝让它参与 tier 判定（「列不出出处的因子不参与判定」），只在返回体的 unmapped 里说明。留着它是为了让这个缺口可见、可被 explain_gap 报出来，而不是假装这个风险因子不存在。" .

<https://example.org/dmo/id/riskRule/ICD-DYSLIPIDEMIA> rdfs:comment "⚠️ 同样没有 riskRuleCitesPassage，同样不参与 tier 判定。" .

