    "For individuals with type 1 diabetes: insulin must never be stopped as this expose them to the risk of DKA.",
    "If using insulin pump/hybrid closed loop system, seek specialist diabetes advice for an individualised care plan.",
    "Individuals with type 1 diabetes require review by the Diabetes-Bariatric Physician.",
    "Individuals with type 1 diabetes could liaise with diabetes teams to adjust further to achieve/maintain optimal diabetes control",
    "If you have type 1 diabetes, your body makes little or no insulin. Your immune system attacks and destroys the cells in your pancreas that make insulin.",
