    "An artificial pancreas is mainly used to help people with type 1 diabetes.", "If you have type 1 diabetes, your doctor may recommend you take other medicines, in addition to insulin, to help control your blood glucose.",
    "If you have type 1 diabetes, your health care team may ask you to check your urine at home for substances called ketones.",
