<https://example.org/dmo/id/recommendation/a1c-goal-below-7-percent> <https://example.org/dmo#evidenceQuote>
    "Studies have shown that some people with diabetes can reduce the risk of diabetes complications by keeping A1C levels below 7 percent." .

<https://example.org/dmo/id/recommendation/a1c-goal-discussion-with-health-care-professional>
  <https://example.org/dmo#evidenceQuote> "You should discuss your A1C target with your health care professional." .

<https://example.org/dmo/id/recommendation/a1c-target-below-7-percent-to-reduce-complications>
