    "The A1C test is sometimes called the hemoglobin A1C, HbA1c, glycated hemoglobin, or glycohemoglobin test.",
    "Screening and diagnosis of prediabetes1", "Screening and diagnosis of type 2 diabetes1",
    "repeat for confirmation of diagnosis", "Diagnosis requires a laboratory test certified by the NGSP and standardized to the DCCT assay.",
