    "African Americans, American Indians and Alaska Natives, Hispanics/Latinos, Pacific Islanders, and older adults are at greater risk of losing vision or going blind from diabetes." .

<https://example.org/dmo/id/riskFactor/pregnancy-with-diabetes> <https://example.org/dmo#evidenceQuote>
