<https://example.org/dmo/id/recommendation/bring-your-own-nail-tools-to-a-salon-to-prevent-infection>
  <https://example.org/dmo#evidenceQuote> "If you want to get a pedicure at a salon, you should bring your own nail tools to prevent getting an infection." .

<https://example.org/dmo/id/recommendation/buy-shoes-at-the-end-of-the-day-for-best-fit>
  <https://example.org/dmo#evidenceQuote> "When buying shoes, make sure they feel good and have enough room for your toes. Buy shoes at the end of the day, when your feet are the largest, so that you can find the best fit." .

<https://example.org/dmo/id/recommendation/call-health-care-provider-for-non-healing-foot-cut-blister-or-bruise>
  <https://example.org/dmo#evidenceQuote> "Call your health care provider right away if you have a cut, blister, or bruise on your foot that does not start to heal after a few days" .

<https://example.org/dmo/id/recommendation/check-the-inside-of-shoes-before-wearing>
  <https://example.org/dmo#evidenceQuote> "Check the inside of your shoes before putting them on, to make sure the lining is smooth and free of pebbles or other objects." .

<https://example.org/dmo/id/recommendation/check-your-feet-every-day> <https://example.org/dmo#evidenceQuote>
