<https://example.org/dmo/id/recommendation/a1c-goal-below-7-percent-for-kidney-protection>
  <https://example.org/dmo#evidenceQuote> "The A1C goal for many people with diabetes is below 7 percent. Ask your health care team what your goal should be. Reaching your goal numbers will help you protect your kidneys." .

<https://example.org/dmo/id/recommendation/blood-pressure-goal-below-140-90-mm-hg-for-kidney-protection>
  <https://example.org/dmo#evidenceQuote> "The blood pressure goal for most people with diabetes is below 140/90 mm Hg. Ask your health care team what your goal should be." .

<https://example.org/dmo/id/recommendation/get-enough-sleep-aim-for-7-to-8-hours-of-sleep-each-night>
