  <https://example.org/dmo#evidenceQuote> "If you have type 2 diabetes, your health care professional may recommend diabetes medicines that may help you lose weight." .

<https://example.org/dmo/id/recommendation/consider-sleep-apnea-as-a-possible-contributor-to-poor-sleep-and-cardiovascular-risk>
  <https://example.org/dmo#evidenceQuote> "People with diabetes and overweight or obesity can also have other health conditions that affect sleep, such as sleep apnea NIH external link, which can raise your blood pressure and risk of heart disease." .

<https://example.org/dmo/id/recommendation/consider-weight-loss-surgery-if-unable-to-reach-healthy-weight-with-other-methods>
  <https://example.org/dmo#evidenceQuote> "Your health care professional may recommend weight-loss surgery if you aren’t able to reach a healthy weight with meal planning, physical activity, and taking diabetes medicines that help with weight loss." .

<https://example.org/dmo/id/recommendation/do-not-try-to-lose-weight-during-pregnancy-without-professional-guidance>
