<https://example.org/dmo/id/lifestyleIntervention/brisk-walking-for-150-minutes-each-week>
  <https://example.org/dmo#evidenceQuote> "If you have gestational diabetes, you can manage your blood glucose level by following a healthy eating plan and doing a moderate-intensity physical activity, such as brisk walking for 150 minutes, each week." .

<https://example.org/dmo/id/lifestyleIntervention/consuming-healthy-meals-and-beverages>
