<https://example.org/dmo/id/lifestyleIntervention/getting-physical-activity> <https://example.org/dmo#evidenceQuote>
    "These lifestyle changes include consuming healthy meals and beverages, limiting calories if they have overweight or obesity, and getting physical activity." .

<https://example.org/dmo/id/lifestyleIntervention/healthy-foods-and-beverages> <https://example.org/dmo#evidenceQuote>
