<https://example.org/dmo/id/symptom/low-blood-glucose-levels> <https://example.org/dmo#evidenceQuote>
    "You should also check your blood glucose levels often to watch for low blood glucose levels in the first few days." .

<https://example.org/dmo/id/symptom/worsening-of-diabetic-eye-disease> <https://example.org/dmo#evidenceQuote>
    "Diabetic eye disease may get worse after you have a baby." .

