<https://example.org/dmo/id/diabetesType/t2dm-tablets> <https://example.org/dmo#evidenceQuote>
    "A middle-aged man with T2DM on metformin with an HbA1c usually around 48mmol/L would not be expected to be at high risk of hypoglycaemia" .

