<https://example.org/dmo/id/labTest/hypoglycaemia-3-0mmol-l> <https://example.org/dmo#evidenceQuote>
    "18.4% of people still reported one or more hypoglycaemic episodes (blood glucose <4.0mmol/L) with 7.0% reporting one or more hypoglycaemic episodes <3.0mmol/L." .

<https://example.org/dmo/id/labTest/looming-hypoglycaemia> <https://example.org/dmo#evidenceQuote>
