  <https://example.org/dmo#evidenceQuote> "Administer the first dose of fast acting subcutaneous insulin preferably prior to breakfast or lunch. Only administer the first dose before the evening meal if appropriate monitoring can be guaranteed. Do not convert to a subcutaneous regimen at bed time." .

