<https://example.org/dmo/id/lifestyleIntervention/三减三健> <https://example.org/dmo#activityTarget>
    "减盐、减油、减糖、健康口腔、健康体重、健康骨骼" .

<https://example.org/dmo/id/lifestyleIntervention/合理膳食> <https://example.org/dmo#activityTarget>
