<https://example.org/dmo/id/labTest/urine-ketones> <https://example.org/dmo#definition>
    "urine ketones", "Ketone test kits are affordable and widely available over the counter to check your ketones at home. You should also test for ketones if you have any of the symptoms of DKA. Elevated ketones are a sign of DKA.",
    "A test to detect ketones in urine, used to monitor for diabetic ketoacidosis (DKA), especially in individuals with type 1 diabetes.",
    "When your body uses fat for energy, your body makes chemicals called ketones. High levels of ketones in your blood can lead to a condition called diabetic ketoacidosis (DKA).",
    "Substances in the urine that indicate the body is breaking down fat for energy, which can happen when there is not enough insulin.",
    "acetoacetate is measured by urinary dipstick" .

