  <https://example.org/dmo#diabetesTypeCode> "diabetes前期" .

<https://example.org/dmo/id/labTest/空腹血糖> <https://example.org/dmo#definition> "空腹血糖是评估糖尿病和糖尿病前期的重要指标，通常指至少8小时未进食后的血糖水平。" .

<https://example.org/dmo/id/labTest/糖尿病风险评估> <https://example.org/dmo#definition>
