<https://example.org/dmo/id/riskFactor/autosomal-recessive-inheritance-of-monogenic-diabetes>
  <https://example.org/dmo#evidenceNote> "Occurs only if a child inherits a gene for the disease from both parents; neither parent has the disease." .

<https://example.org/dmo/id/riskFactor/family-history-of-monogenic-diabetes> <https://example.org/dmo#evidenceNote>
    "Health care professionals test for monogenic diabetes if the patient has family members with these forms of diabetes." .

<https://example.org/dmo/id/riskFactor/gene-variant-in-a-single-gene> <https://example.org/dmo#evidenceNote>
