    "Before you take these drugs, tell your doctor if you have kidney or liver problems." .

<https://example.org/dmo/id/contraindication/pregnancy> <https://example.org/dmo#rationale>
    "Before you start taking these medicines, tell your health provider if: you have liver or kidney problems you are pregnant or breastfeeding" .

