    "Reduce basal insulin by 50% at start LRD. May need optimisation" .

<https://example.org/dmo/id/contraindication/basal-insulin-regimens> <https://example.org/dmo#rationale>
    "Reduce the total daily insulin dose by 50% at start LRD. May need optimisation" .

<https://example.org/dmo/id/contraindication/dipeptidyl-peptidase-4-inhibitors> <https://example.org/dmo#rationale>
    "Discontinue. Can be restarted if there is a need to optimise glycaemic control or there is intolerance of metformin" .

