  <https://example.org/dmo#statement> "Sulfonylureas should be discontinued after metabolic-bariatric surgery due to risk of hypoglycaemia. May be continued at a lower dose if postoperative glucose levels are elevated. Discuss with diabetes team." .

<https://example.org/dmo/id/recommendation/discontinue-sulfonylureas-at-start-of-lrd>
  <https://example.org/dmo#statement> "Discontinue at start of LRD" .

