    "Document type of diabetes" .

<https://example.org/dmo/id/recommendation/ensure-access-to-and-knowledge-of-blood-glucose-monitoring-and-hypoglycaemia-management-for-individuals-on-sulfonylureas-meglitinides-or-insulin>
  <https://example.org/dmo#statement> "All individuals with diabetes on sulfonylureas, meglitinides or insulin therapies must have access to and knowledge of how to perform blood glucose monitoring and how to prevent and manage hypoglycaemia." .

