  <https://example.org/dmo#statement> "Ensure regular follow-up with the usual diabetes care provider" .

<https://example.org/dmo/id/recommendation/ensure-that-the-referral-letter-states-all-of-the-recommended-information-outlined-in-local-national-available-guidelines>
  <https://example.org/dmo#statement> "Ensure that the referral letter states all of the recommended information outlined in local/national available guidelines" .

<https://example.org/dmo/id/recommendation/ensure-the-classification-of-diabetes-eg-autoimmune-diabetes-type-2-diabetes-secondary-diabetes-is-clearly-documented-prior-to-surgical-referral-and-assessment>
