  <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "风险规则必须指向一个具体的风险因子概念。" .

_:node661 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#path> <https://example.org/dmo#sha256>;
  <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#minCount> 1;
