  <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "出处必须指向本仓库的采集副本。" .

_:node663 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#path> <https://example.org/dmo#patientId>;
  <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#minCount> 1;
  <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#maxCount> 1;
  <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "患者必须有唯一标识。" .

_:node664 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#path> <https://example.org/dmo#factOrigin>;
  <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#maxCount> 1;
  <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "事实来源层只能是 ehr-legacy / derived / demo-cohort 之一 —— 演示数据必须能和真实数据区分开。";
  <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#in> _:node665 .

_:node668 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#path> <https://example.org/dmo#ruleId>;
  <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#minCount> 1;
  <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "评估必须记录是哪条规则得出的 —— 结论不可归因就无法复核。" .

_:node669 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#path> <https://example.org/dmo#ruleVersion>;
  <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#minCount> 1;
  <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "评估必须记录规则版本：规则改了以后，旧结论要能被识别出来。" .

_:node670 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#path> <https://example.org/dmo#appliesThreshold>;
  <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#minCount> 1;
  <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#maxCount> 1;
  <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "评估必须指明用了哪条阈值。" .

_:node671 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#path> <https://example.org/dmo#basedOnLabResult>;
  <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#minCount> 1;
  <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "评估必须挂到至少一条检验结果上。凭空的结论不可用。" .

_:node672 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#path> <https://example.org/dmo#diagnosisKind>;
  <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#minCount> 1;
  <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#maxCount> 1;
  <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "诊断记录必须声明类别。";
  <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#in> _:node673 .

_:node678 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#path> <https://example.org/dmo#diagnosisType>;
  <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#maxCount> 1;
  <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "一条 Diagnosis 至多指向一个分型。多于一个会让 owl2-rl 沿 FunctionalProperty 推出两个分型 owl:sameAs，与 AllDisjointClasses 冲突 —— 整个本体不一致且不报错（plan R-2）。" .

_:node681 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#path> <https://example.org/dmo#rationale>;
  <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#minCount> 1;
  <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "禁忌规则必须带出处原话 —— 无依据的用药禁令比没有更危险。" .

_:node682 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#path> <https://example.org/dmo#severity>;
  <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#minCount> 1;
  <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#maxCount> 1;
  <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "禁忌必须声明强度：绝对禁忌与需谨慎评估的处置完全不同。";
  <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#in> _:node683 .

_:node776 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#path> <https://example.org/dmo#resultValue>;
  <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#minCount> 1;
  <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#maxCount> 1;
  <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "检验结果必须有数值。" .

_:node777 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#path> <https://example.org/dmo#resultUnit>;
  <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#minCount> 1;
  <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "检验结果必须带单位。无单位的数值在临床上没有意义，也无法与阈值比对。" .

_:node778 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#path> <https://example.org/dmo#measuredByTest>;
  <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#minCount> 1;
  <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "检验结果必须指明对应的检验项目，否则无法定位适用阈值。" .

_:node779 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#path> <https://example.org/dmo#valueTrustLevel>;
  <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#maxCount> 1;
  <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "可信度只能是 Attested / Curated / Unverified 之一。";
  <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#in> _:node780 .

_:node785 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#path> <https://example.org/dmo#boundUnit>;
  <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#minCount> 1;
  <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "阈值必须带单位。" .

_:node786 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#path> <https://example.org/dmo#populationContext>;
  <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#minCount> 1;
  <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "阈值必须声明适用人群：妊娠期与非妊娠期 cutoff 不同。";
  <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#in> _:node787 .

_:node791 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#path> <https://example.org/dmo#lowerOperator>;
  <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#minCount> 1;
  <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#maxCount> 1;
  <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "必须显式声明下界比较符。省略它会逼查询层用 OPTIONAL+BOUND 猜，多一层就多一个静默漏判。";
  <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#in> _:node792 .

_:node795 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#path> <https://example.org/dmo#upperOperator>;
  <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#minCount> 1;
  <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#maxCount> 1;
  <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "必须显式声明上界比较符。";
  <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#in> _:node796 .

_:node799 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#path> <https://example.org/dmo#confirmationRequired>;
  <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#minCount> 1;
  <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#maxCount> 1;
  <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "必须声明是否需要复测确认 —— 这是「单次异常 ≠ 确诊」的数据基础。" .

_:node804 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#path> <https://example.org/dmo#quote>;
  <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#minCount> 1;
  <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "出处片段必须有逐字原文。" .

_:node805 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#path> <https://example.org/dmo#contentHash>;
  <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#minCount> 1;
  <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "出处片段必须有 sha256 内容哈希 —— 原文改了而哈希没改，靠 verify_passages.py 抓出来。";
  <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#pattern> "^[0-9a-f]{64}$" .

_:node806 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#path> <https://example.org/dmo#passageId>;
  <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#minCount> 1;
  <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#maxCount> 1;
