_:node980 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#path> <https://example.org/dmo#diagnosisType>;
  <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#maxCount> 1;
  <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "一条 Diagnosis 至多指向一个分型。多于一个会让 owl2-rl 沿 FunctionalProperty 推出两个分型 owl:sameAs，与 AllDisjointClasses 冲突 —— 整个本体不一致且不报错（plan R-2）。" .

_:node983 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#path> <https://example.org/dmo#rationale>;
  <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#minCount> 1;
  <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "禁忌规则必须带出处原话 —— 无依据的用药禁令比没有更危险。" .

_:node984 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#path> <https://example.org/dmo#severity>;
  <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#minCount> 1;
  <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#maxCount> 1;
  <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "禁忌必须声明强度：绝对禁忌与需谨慎评估的处置完全不同。";
  <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#in> _:node985 .

_:node306 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "resultUnit 与 LabTest.unitOfMeasure 不一致 —— 单位错配会让阈值判断整体失效。";
  <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#prefixes> <https://example.org/dmo#>;
  <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#select> """
            SELECT $this ?value WHERE {
              $this <https://example.org/dmo#resultUnit> ?value .
              $this <https://example.org/dmo#measuredByTest> ?t .
              ?t <https://example.org/dmo#unitOfMeasure> ?expected .
              FILTER(?value != ?expected)
            }""" .

_:node314 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "阈值既无下界也无上界，等于没有约束。";
  <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#prefixes> <https://example.org/dmo#>;
  <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#select> """
            SELECT $this WHERE {
              FILTER NOT EXISTS { $this <https://example.org/dmo#lowerBound> ?l }
              FILTER NOT EXISTS { $this <https://example.org/dmo#upperBound> ?u }
            }""" .

_:node319 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "临床安全违规：患者存在 {?cond}，而所用药物属于对此有绝对禁忌的类别。";
  <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#prefixes> <https://example.org/dmo#>;
  <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#select> """
            SELECT $this ?cond WHERE {
              $this <https://example.org/dmo#takesMedication> ?med .
