            }""" .

_:node633 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "有 sourceUnit 却没有 sourceValue（或反之）—— 单位换算的原始值必须成对保留。";
  <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#prefixes> <https://example.org/dmo#>;
  <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#select> """
            SELECT $this WHERE {
              { $this <https://example.org/dmo#sourceUnit> ?su .
                FILTER NOT EXISTS { $this <https://example.org/dmo#sourceValue> ?sv } }
              UNION
              { $this <https://example.org/dmo#sourceValue> ?sv .
                FILTER NOT EXISTS { $this <https://example.org/dmo#sourceUnit> ?su } }
            }""";
  <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#severity> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#Warning> .

_:node649 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "阈值没有可校验的出处片段（thresholdCitesPassage → SourcePassage.contentHash）——无出处的临床数字不可用。";
  <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#prefixes> <https://example.org/dmo#>;
  <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#select> """
            SELECT $this WHERE {
              FILTER NOT EXISTS {
                $this <https://example.org/dmo#thresholdCitesPassage> ?p .
                ?p <https://example.org/dmo#contentHash> ?h .
              }
            }""" .

_:node650 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "阈值上下界都声明为 None，等于没有约束。";
  <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#prefixes> <https://example.org/dmo#>;
  <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#select> """
            SELECT $this WHERE {
              $this <https://example.org/dmo#lowerOperator> \"None\" .
              $this <https://example.org/dmo#upperOperator> \"None\" .
            }""" .

_:node651 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "声明了下界比较符却没有 lowerBound（或声明 None 却给了 lowerBound）——两者必须配套。";
  <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#prefixes> <https://example.org/dmo#>;
  <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#select> """
            SELECT $this WHERE {
              { $this <https://example.org/dmo#lowerOperator> ?op .
                FILTER(?op != \"None\")
                FILTER NOT EXISTS { $this <https://example.org/dmo#lowerBound> ?b } }
              UNION
              { $this <https://example.org/dmo#lowerOperator> \"None\" .
                $this <https://example.org/dmo#lowerBound> ?b }
            }""" .

_:node652 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "声明了上界比较符却没有 upperBound（或声明 None 却给了 upperBound）——两者必须配套。";
  <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#prefixes> <https://example.org/dmo#>;
  <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#select> """
            SELECT $this WHERE {
              { $this <https://example.org/dmo#upperOperator> ?op .
                FILTER(?op != \"None\")
                FILTER NOT EXISTS { $this <https://example.org/dmo#upperBound> ?b } }
              UNION
              { $this <https://example.org/dmo#upperOperator> \"None\" .
                $this <https://example.org/dmo#upperBound> ?b }
            }""" .

_:node660 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "triggerBasis=external-standard 却没有 externalStandardNote —— 边界来自语料之外时必须说明出处，否则用户无从判断可信度。";
  <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#prefixes> <https://example.org/dmo#>;
  <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#select> """
            SELECT $this WHERE {
              $this <https://example.org/dmo#triggerBasis> \"external-standard\" .
              FILTER NOT EXISTS { $this <https://example.org/dmo#externalStandardNote> ?n }
            }""" .

_:node679 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "verificationStatus=Provisional 却没有 caveat —— 「单次异常不等于确诊」这句话必须写出来，不能指望读的人自己想到。";
  <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#prefixes> <https://example.org/dmo#>;
  <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#select> """
            SELECT $this WHERE {
              $this <https://example.org/dmo#verificationStatus> \"Provisional\" .
              FILTER NOT EXISTS { $this <https://example.org/dmo#caveat> ?c }
            }""" .

_:node680 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "临床安全违规：患者存在活动性的 {?cond}，而在用药物属于对此有绝对禁忌的类别（{?rationale}）。";
  <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#prefixes> <https://example.org/dmo#>;
  <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#select> """
            SELECT $this ?cond ?rationale WHERE {
              $this <https://example.org/dmo#hasMedicationUse> ?mu .
              # 只看在用的药。停药/已完成的疗程不构成当下的安全问题。
              # 刻意用 NOT EXISTS 而不是 status=\"Active\"：没写 status 的记录
              # 按「可能在用」处理 —— 安全形状宁可多报，不可漏报。
              FILTER NOT EXISTS {
                ?mu <https://example.org/dmo#status> ?st .
                FILTER(?st IN (\"Completed\", \"Stopped\"))
              }
              ?mu <https://example.org/dmo#usesMedication> ?med .
              ?med <https://example.org/dmo#belongsToDrugClass> ?cls .
              ?cls <https://example.org/dmo#hasContraindication> ?contra .
              ?contra <https://example.org/dmo#severity> \"Absolute\" .
              ?contra <https://example.org/dmo#triggeredByCondition> ?cond .
              ?contra <https://example.org/dmo#rationale> ?rationale .

              $this <https://example.org/dmo#hasDiagnosis> ?dx .
              ?dx <https://example.org/dmo#diagnosisComplication> ?cond .
              # 同理：没写 clinicalStatus 的按「可能仍活动」处理。
              FILTER NOT EXISTS {
                ?dx <https://example.org/dmo#clinicalStatus> ?cs .
                FILTER(?cs IN (\"Resolved\", \"Inactive\"))
              }
            }""";
  <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#severity> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#Violation> .

_:node686 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "同一患者有两条已确诊且分型不同的糖尿病诊断（{?t1} / {?t2}）——分型互斥公理下这会推出不一致。";
  <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#prefixes> <https://example.org/dmo#>;
  <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#select> """
            SELECT $this ?t1 ?t2 WHERE {
              $this <https://example.org/dmo#hasDiagnosis> ?d1, ?d2 .
              ?d1 <https://example.org/dmo#diagnosisKind> \"Diabetes\" ;
                  <https://example.org/dmo#verificationStatus> \"Confirmed\" ;
                  <https://example.org/dmo#diagnosisType> ?t1 .
              ?d2 <https://example.org/dmo#diagnosisKind> \"Diabetes\" ;
                  <https://example.org/dmo#verificationStatus> \"Confirmed\" ;
                  <https://example.org/dmo#diagnosisType> ?t2 .
              FILTER(STR(?t1) < STR(?t2))
              # DM-Unspecified 与任何具体分型并存是合法的：它表示「还没分型」，
              # 不是第六种类型（dmo-axioms.ttl §8）。
              FILTER(?t1 != <https://example.org/dmo/id/DM-Unspecified>)
              FILTER(?t2 != <https://example.org/dmo/id/DM-Unspecified>)
            }""";
  <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#severity> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#Violation> .

_:node783 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "resultUnit 与 LabTest.unitOfMeasure 不一致 —— 单位错配会让阈值判断整体失效。";
  <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#prefixes> <https://example.org/dmo#>;
  <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#select> """
            SELECT $this ?value WHERE {
              $this <https://example.org/dmo#resultUnit> ?value .
              $this <https://example.org/dmo#measuredByTest> ?t .
              ?t <https://example.org/dmo#unitOfMeasure> ?expected .
              FILTER(?value != ?expected)
            }""" .

_:node784 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "有 sourceUnit 却没有 sourceValue（或反之）—— 单位换算的原始值必须成对保留。";
